ải_thưởng\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Giải thưởng\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Flow X13 (2023) GV302 Video review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-video\" id=\"Video_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Video review\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Flow X13 (2023) GV302 Media review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-media\" id=\"Media_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Media review\n      </li></ul></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-awards\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Giải_thưởng\"><div class=\"ProductAward__productAwardPagePadding__dSaZj\"><div class=\"ProductAward__awardTitle__GUset\"><h2 class=\"pageAward vnRogFont ProductAward__vnRogFontSize__5eSiT\">\n        Giải thưởng \n      </h2> <span>(3)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__mobileAwardContent__LNDCh\"><ul class=\"ProductAward__rewardContainer__sHbkR ProductAward__rewardItemLessThanThree__qeW8A\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1328/202004272001044250054.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"4.5 / 5\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      giz.ro\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>4.5 / 5</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The Asus ROG Flow X13 is an unrivalled computer in the compact, lightweight and powerful laptop class. The Generation 2023 is a major update to the ROG Flow X13 range, bringing massive performance and cooling improvements, updated connectivity, a bigger battery and a good quality QHD+ display. The price of this series isn't exactly affordable, but you'll find this Flow in several configurations that cover the needs and affordability of potential customers.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>ROMANIA</span> <span>10/20/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Flow X13 (2023) GV302 Media review Award of 4.5 / 5\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.giz.ro/reviews/asus-rog-flow-x13-review-68820/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1328/202004272022587110310.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"4.5 / 5\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      ultrabookreview.com\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>4.5 / 5</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Having used this 2023 Asus ROG Flow X13 for the last few months, I still find it unmatched by any other device available out there as an all-purpose compact and lightweight laptop. However, this generation is a major refinement of the past design, with a boost in performance and internal cooling, updated inputs and IO, a larger battery, and a display that makes a lot more sense for this format and hardware. All these are on top of the versatile 360 convertible format and classy black design.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>ROMANIA</span> <span>09/15/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Flow X13 (2023) GV302 Media review Award of 4.5 / 5\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.ultrabookreview.com/64420-asus-rog-flow-x13-gen3-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1328/202004272022587110310.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"4.25 / 5\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      ultrabookreview.com\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>4.25 / 5</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ROG Flow Z13 is still a unique device, a powerful all-purpose computer in a compact 13-inch tablet form factor. In fact, it’s significantly more powerful in this 2023 update than the previous generation and offers a display that’s better suited for everyday use, creative work, and gaming.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>ROMANIA</span> <span>03/07/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Flow X13 (2023) GV302 Media review Award of 4.25 / 5\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.ultrabookreview.com/62336-asus-rog-flow-z13-gen2-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://